    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The new `deleteMany` predicate changed from a scoped SMS/past-date cleanup to `OR: [{ method: SMS, scheduledDate <= now }, { retryCount > 1 }]`. This will delete any `WorkflowReminder` with `retryCount > 1` regardless of method or scheduled date, which is a destructive contract change from the comment and prior behavior. It can remove non-SMS reminders and future reminders before the later scheduling/update logic can process them.",
